# Coverage output. `vitest run --coverage` writes an 80-file lcov-report and a
# `git add -A` swept it into a push; it is regenerated by every run, so a diff
# of it says nothing and a reviewer scrolls past 2.5 MB to reach the change.
coverage/
*.lcov
